@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 40
title Renewal and scheduled jobs - focused design - REVIEW
class InternalJobController {
  +trigger(code: JobCode, runKey: String, date: LocalDate): JobRun
  +status(code: JobCode, runId: UUID): JobRun
 }
class JobCoordinator {
  +getOrCreate(code: JobCode, runKey: String, cutoff: Instant): JobRun
  +claimLease(run: UUID): Fence
  +checkpoint(run: UUID, fence: long, cursor: String): void
 }
class RenewalWorker {
  +scanDue(batch: int): int
  +process(target: RenewalTarget): void
 }
class LifecycleJob {
  +run(date: LocalDate, fence: Fence): JobResult
  +expireAccountsAndSubscriptions(batch: int): int
 }
class ConsumptionSummaryJob {
  +run(date: LocalDate, fence: Fence): JobResult
 }
class SubscriptionService {
  +register(claim: Claim, root: UUID, expectedVersion: long): SubscriptionResult
  +renew(target: RenewalTarget): RenewalResult
 }
class CancellationService {
  +persistIntent(claim: Claim, root: UUID, expectedVersion: long): PendingIntent
  +confirmAfterCommit(intent: UUID): CancellationResult
  +resolvePending(intent: UUID): CancellationResult
 }
class DailySummaryService {
  +getOrCreatePeriod(date: LocalDate, run: UUID): ReportPeriod
  +freezeContributionsSingleStatement(period: UUID): int
  +finalizeFromPersistedMembers(period: UUID): Summary
 }
interface AccountStore {
  +lock(accountId: UUID): Account
  +updateBalance(change: BalanceChange): void
 }
InternalJobController --> JobCoordinator
RenewalWorker --> SubscriptionService : shared cycle core
LifecycleJob --> SubscriptionService
LifecycleJob --> CancellationService : resolve pending
LifecycleJob --> AccountStore
LifecycleJob --> JobCoordinator
ConsumptionSummaryJob --> DailySummaryService
ConsumptionSummaryJob --> JobCoordinator
note bottom of RenewalWorker
  One target cycle and one fee across manual / worker / JOB-01.
  Persist insufficient-funds attempt as final for that target.
  Technical recovery creates only one late cycle, no backdating.
  Renewal cadence is a proposal; UC01 recovery alone is 60s.
end note
legend bottom
  Focused view: selected classes from backend-design-class.puml.
  Cross-cutting access checks / operation coordination remain in full overview.
  Methods show responsibilities and ports, not JPA entities.
endlegend
@enduml
